<dc:title>Tuning the photophysical properties of a (P,N)Re-I complex by adding a -NH- fragment into a P,N-bidentate ligand: The case of [P,N{(C6H5)(2)(C5H4N)NHPRe(CO)(3)Br]</dc:title>
<dc:creator>Mella, Pablo</dc:creator>
<dc:creator>Carlos Palma, Juan</dc:creator>
<dc:creator>Cepeda Plaza, Marjorie</dc:creator>
